  "notes": [
    "Maximums and minimums are per every 1,000 points unless otherwise stated (p. 115). The builder applies them as written, which is right for armies up to 1,000 points; scale them up yourself for larger armies.",
    "A Dutch/Belgian brigade's 2-5 battalions come from 1-3 Line, 1-3 Militia and 0-2 Jäger; the builder checks the maximums but not that there's a Line and a Militia battalion.",
    "A Nassau brigade's Militia battalion (one per army) is the Nassau Landwehr, 3 points less than a Line battalion.",
    "The Horse Artillery battery can be split into two half batteries at 15 points each, each with a separate cavalry brigade. Half batteries cost half points, rounded up (Foot 14, Horse 15), with the usual half battery stat line (2-1-1, Stamina 1).",
    "Named commanders have no official points cost in this supplement; they're priced here at the Divisional Commander cost for their Staff Rating, so adjust as you agree."
  ],
