  "specialRules": [
    "Netherlands and Nassau infantry: Must Form Square, Mixed Formation and Column of Companies (see the British rules), and they can use Attack Column. Line, Militia and Landwehr battalions can form skirmish order in terrain they couldn't normally enter.",
    "Dutch and Belgian cavalry can form Line, Deep Formation (see the British rules) and March Column."
  ]
